{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-brings-physics-interpretations","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:brings-physics-interpretations","kind":"remark","title":"Physics interpretations of the $S_5$-symmetric structure","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-brings-realisations","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-archimedean-leptons"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-brings-surface","tags":["lepton","chirality","colour","brings-surface","S5"],"text":"brings-physics-interpretations.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"rem:brings-physics-interpretations\"></a>\n<strong>Remark.</strong> <em>Physics interpretations of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S_5</code>-symmetric structure</em></p>\n<p>Physics interpretations—lepton generations, chirality, colour—are further realisations of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S_5</code>-symmetric structure of Bring's surface. See <a href=\"#rem:archimedean-leptons\">Descartes leptons</a> in <a href=\"#chap:brings-surface\">Chapter 7</a>.</p>\n"}
